  "characters": [
    {
      "role": "MAIN",
      "node": {
        "id": 145157,
        "name": {
          "full": "Shuichi Kagaya",
          "native": "加賀谷修一",
          "alternative": []
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b145157-nnxG6YFOekWk.png"
        },
        "description": "Shuichi is a third-year high school student and wants to be a normal person and wants things to stay the same forever. but he is scared of himself as he has the ability to turn into a monster.\n\nHis abilities allow​ him to transform into a mascot character which gives him enhanced physical strength and sense of smell. It also has a zipper which can be unzipped so that someone can go inside of him. This will allow that person to control Shuichi's body. \n\nIf he and the person inside of him have the same goals, he can collaborate with them and join forces and fuse together to become one being and their soul, body and memories will be connected and they will be able to overcome their limits.\n~!In the past, Shuichi and Elena were a couple.!~",
        "gender": "Male",
        "age": null
      },
      "voiceActors": [
        {
          "id": 111635,
          "name": {
            "full": "Natsuki Hanae",
            "native": "花江夏樹"
          },
          "image": {
            "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n111635-L385UcjTKCBq.png"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "MAIN",
      "node": {
        "id": 145159,
        "name": {
          "full": "Clair Aoki",
          "native": "青木紅愛",
          "alternative": []
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b145159-aNS7tu2Ad3Nt.png"
        },
        "description": "A female freshman from Shuichi's highschool that in the beginning of the series attempts to commit suicide by immolation due to the death of her parents to the hands of a \"monster.\" She is saved from this situation by Shuichi. Whilst being saved, she discovers Shuichi's other form and with this information she later convinces him into doing what she wants him to do.\n\nShe is a rather smart girl that takes advantage of any opportunity to gain the upper hand in any given situation be it by using her female attributes (mostly against Shuichi) or by using the enemies' secrets and goals against them. She is also quite emotionally complex, being very caring and concerned for the people that she cares about while at the same being able to kill someone in order to ensure that she and the people closest to her survive but feeling terrible with herself after the fact. She also massively enjoys the power that comes with teaming up with Shuichi to the point of almost sexual pleasure.",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": null
      },
      "voiceActors": [
        {
          "id": 106184,
